          "date": "1979-01-01"
        },
        {
          "event": "Following a deal agreed during 1978, French carmaker Peugeot completes a takeover of American manufacturer Chrysler 's European operations , which are based in Britain's former Rootes Group factories, as well as the former Simca factories in France.",
