          "event": "January 7 – Cambodian–Vietnamese War : The People's Army of Vietnam and Vietnamese-backed Cambodian insurgents announce the fall of Phnom Penh , Cambodia, and the collapse of the Pol Pot regime. Pol Pot and the Khmer Rouge retreat west to an area along the Thai border, ending large-scale fighting.",
          "date": "1979-01-07"
