          "event": "January 9 – The Music for UNICEF Concert is held at the United Nations General Assembly to raise money for UNICEF and promote the Year of the Child. It is broadcast the following day in the United States and around the world. Hosted by the Bee Gees , other performers include Donna Summer , ABBA , Rod Stewart and Earth, Wind & Fire . A soundtrack album is later released.",
          "date": "1979-01-09"
